, then do_richcompare)."] [259 2 "// two exact ints or two exact floats: their own comparison, which recurses into nothing (202b)"] [279 1 "// doRichCompare is do_richcompare: a's method, then b's swapped one, then identity for == and !=."] [309 1 "// Eq is a == b as a Go bool (identity first, as PyObject_RichCompareBool)."] [321 1 "// GetAttr is getattr(o, name)."] [336 1 "// Call is f(*args) with the last len(kwnames) of args keyword arguments."] [345 1 "// GetIter is iter(o)."] [356 1 "// Next is next(it): (nil, nil) at the end."] [365 1 "// GetItem is o[key]."] [367 2 "// an exact list's or tuple's item at an int in range: the slot's answer without its conversions (202b)"] [398 1 "// seqIter is the iterator of a type with __getitem__ and no __iter__ (PY5b: its type registered)."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[72 27] [104 39] [111 36] [225 39] [228 36] [238 36] [248 34] [262 23] [266 25] [282 30] [288 36] [294 36] [325 32] [347 29] [368 24] [376 28] [386 32] [389 23] [390 41] [424 29]]} (go/file "abstract.go" :imports [

